# Intentionally empty.
#
# This file used to ignore index.html, index_ecac.html and metodologia.html back
# when the site was scratch output. It is now the deploy artefact: Cloudflare
# Pages serves this directory straight from the GitHub repo, so the generated
# HTML has to be committed. Ignoring it here means Pages publishes an empty site.
#
# Regenerate with (the env vars are not optional — without them site_build.py
# silently reads the small box and nobody notices):
#
#   ADSB_ROOT=$PWD ADSB_DECOMP_DIR=$PWD/data/decomposition_ecac \
#   ADSB_CALIB=$PWD/data/calibration_ecac.json \
#   ADSB_AIRPORTS_CSV=$PWD/data/airports_ecac.csv \
#   ADSB_SITE_OUT=$PWD/site/index.html \
#   lab-venv/bin/python lab/site_build.py
